{
  "A multi-line text input. The box can grow with its content or be resized by the user, and it supports a character counter, a clear button and Ctrl+Enter to submit, along with the label, help text and validation common to all fields.": "",
  "Every prop accepts a value or a function, and `x-model` provides two-way binding for the text. When you create the component with `new`, set the same properties programmatically.": "",
  "Auto-grow": "",
  "With `autoGrow`, the box adjusts to its content. It stays between `minRows` and `maxRows` lines and scrolls beyond that. When the box gets narrower, text wraps onto more lines and the box grows accordingly.": "",
  "Resizing": "",
  "The grip in the corner of the box lets the user resize it vertically (`vertical`, the default) or in both directions (`both`). Set `none` to disable resizing.": "",
  "Character counter and limits": "",
  "`maxLength` stops input at the limit, and `minLength` is checked when the field loses focus. `showCounter` displays the count below the box.": "",
  "Ctrl+Enter": "Ctrl+Enter",
  "Enter starts a new line. Ctrl+Enter (Cmd+Enter on a Mac) raises `onEnter` with the value, which is the usual way to send a message or save a note.": "",
  "Read-only, disabled and required": "",
  "Inserts a new line.": "",
  "Moves focus out of the field. The clear button is not a Tab stop, because Escape does the same thing.": "",
  "A native `<textarea>` associated with its `<label>` through `for`.": "",
  "If Ctrl+Enter sends something, mention it in the label or help text, as the example above does.": "",
  "The name of the clear button and the validation messages come from `uiLocale.strings`.": "Temizleme düğmesinin adı ve validation iletileri `uiLocale.strings` değerinden gelir.",
  "TextArea uses the field tokens (`field.*`, see TextBox) and has none of its own, so its first line aligns with a single-line field of the same size.": "",
  "The field. `data-resize`, `data-auto-grow` and the field attributes (`data-size`, `data-variant`, `data-label-mode`, `data-invalid`, `data-readonly`, `data-disabled`, `data-filled`).": "",
  "The box, which carries the resize grip.": "",
  "The textarea.": "Textarea.",
  "The clear button.": "Temizleme düğmesi.",
  "The text, with lines separated by `\\n`. `x-model` provides two-way binding.": "",
  "The number of visible lines.": "",
  "The box adjusts to its content, from `minRows` to `maxRows` lines, and then scrolls.": "",
  "The minimum height with `autoGrow`.": "",
  "The maximum height with `autoGrow`. Without it, the box grows without limit.": "",
  "`none`, `vertical` or `both`: the directions the user can resize the box. This is `none` while `autoGrow` is on.": "",
  "Length limits. Both are enforced by validation.": "",
  "Shows `12/500` below the box (`12` without `maxLength`).": "",
  "With `change`, the value updates when the field loses focus or the user presses Ctrl+Enter.": "",
  "`off` keeps long lines on one line and scrolls horizontally.": "",
  "Passed to the `<textarea>`.": "`<textarea>` öğesine aktarılır.",
  "The native `<textarea>`.": "Yerel `<textarea>`.",
  "Sets focus on the textarea.": "",
  "Occurs when the user presses Ctrl+Enter (Cmd+Enter). `e`: `{ value, source, event }`.": "",
  "DOM events from the textarea bubble up to the field.": ""
}
